          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "\n<div class=\"mpdp-benefits\">\n  <div class=\"mpdp-benefit\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"11\" stroke=\"#7DA614\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/><path d=\"M7 12l3.2 3.2L17 8.5\" stroke=\"#7DA614\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\/><\/svg><\/span><span>Built specifically for Ozempic&reg;, Wegovy&reg; &amp; Mounjaro&reg; side effects<\/span><\/div>\n  <div class=\"mpdp-benefit\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"11\" stroke=\"#7DA614\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/><path d=\"M7 12l3.2 3.2L17 8.5\" stroke=\"#7DA614\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\/><\/svg><\/span><span>Works in the stomach, not the colon &mdash; gentle, no cramping<\/span><\/div>\n  <div class=\"mpdp-benefit\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"11\" stroke=\"#7DA614\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/><path d=\"M7 12l3.2 3.2L17 8.5\" stroke=\"#7DA614\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\/><\/svg><\/span><span>Apigenin from celery juice + chlorophyll + 5g prebiotic fiber<\/span><\/div>\n  <div class=\"mpdp-benefit\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"11\" stroke=\"#7DA614\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/><path d=\"M7 12l3.2 3.2L17 8.5\" stroke=\"#7DA614\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\/><\/svg><\/span><span>90-day money-back guarantee &mdash; keep the results, lose the misery<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n"
          },
