          "name": "Guarantee + Warning",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"motilli-mbg\">\n  <div class=\"motilli-mbg__badge\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"72\" height=\"72\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\n      <defs>\n        <path id=\"motilli-mbg-arc-top\" d=\"M 50,50 m -40,0 a 40,40 0 1,1 80,0\" fill=\"none\"\/>\n        <path id=\"motilli-mbg-arc-bot\" d=\"M 50,50 m -40,0 a 40,40 0 1,0 80,0\" fill=\"none\"\/>\n      <\/defs>\n      <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"46\" fill=\"#1f3a2b\"\/>\n      <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"42\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"\/>\n      <text fill=\"#ffffff\" style=\"font:700 9px Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1.2px;\">\n        <textPath href=\"#motilli-mbg-arc-top\" startOffset=\"50%\" text-anchor=\"middle\">MONEY BACK<\/textPath>\n      <\/text>\n      <text fill=\"#ffffff\" style=\"font:700 9px Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1.2px;\">\n        <textPath href=\"#motilli-mbg-arc-bot\" startOffset=\"50%\" text-anchor=\"middle\" side=\"right\">GUARANTEE<\/textPath>\n      <\/text>\n      <text x=\"50\" y=\"44\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" style=\"font:800 18px Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;\">90<\/text>\n      <text x=\"50\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" style=\"font:700 9px Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\">DAY<\/text>\n    <\/svg>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"motilli-mbg__copy\">\n    <p class=\"motilli-mbg__title\">90-Day Money Back Guarantee<\/p>\n    <p class=\"motilli-mbg__sub\">Results or a full refund. No return required. No questions asked.<\/p>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<style>\n  .motilli-mbg { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 14px 16px; background: #f7f5ef; border: 1px solid #e6e2d4; border-radius: 10px; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n  .motilli-mbg__badge { flex: 0 0 72px; display: inline-flex; }  \/* bust:1779777522 *\/\n  .motilli-mbg__copy { flex: 1; }\n  .motilli-mbg__title { font: 700 16px\/1.2 Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; color: #1a2420; margin: 0 0 4px; }\n  .motilli-mbg__sub { font: 400 14px\/1.4 Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; color: #4a5159; margin: 0; }\n  @media (max-width: 480px) {\n    .motilli-mbg { padding: 12px 14px; gap: 12px; }\n    .motilli-mbg__title { font-size: 15px; }\n    .motilli-mbg__sub { font-size: 13px; }\n  }\n<\/style>\n<div class=\"motilli-lowstock\">\n  <div class=\"motilli-lowstock__header\">\n    <span class=\"motilli-lowstock__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">!<\/span>\n    <strong>WARNING: Low Stock Notice<\/strong>\n  <\/div>\n  <p class=\"motilli-lowstock__body\">This product sold out <strong>12 times<\/strong> last year. We encourage you to take advantage of the <strong>limited sale<\/strong> and buy now. Subscribing protects you against future stockouts. <strong>PS:<\/strong> Only available here, don't buy fakes on Amazon\/eBay.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<style>\n  .motilli-lowstock { border: 2px dashed #e8b3b3; background: #fdf2f2; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 16px; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n  .motilli-lowstock__header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 8px; font: 700 15px\/1.2 Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; color: #9b2c2c; }\n  .motilli-lowstock__icon { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 22px; height: 22px; background: #9b2c2c; color: #fff; border-radius: 50%; font: 800 14px\/1 Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; }\n  .motilli-lowstock__body { font: 400 14px\/1.55 Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; color: #9b2c2c; margin: 0; }\n  .motilli-lowstock__body strong { font-weight: 700; }\n<\/style>"
