        "list_faq": {
          "type": "custom-liquid",
          "name": "FAQ Accordion",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"motilli-faq\">\n  <details class=\"motilli-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"motilli-faq__q\"><span>Why Nothing Else Has Worked &mdash; And How Motilli Does<\/span><span class=\"motilli-faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/summary>\n    <div class=\"motilli-faq__a\">\n      <p>Your GLP-1 slowed your stomach by up to 70%. Every laxative, fiber, magnesium, and probiotic on your bathroom shelf was built for a colon problem. Your colon is fine. Your stomach is the problem &mdash; six feet upstream from where any of those products can reach.<\/p>\n      <p>Motilli is the first formula built to wake the stomach back up. Apigenin from celery juice tells the stomach muscle to start contracting. Chlorophyllin neutralizes the sulphur compounds that build up while food sits stalled. Soluble fiber supports the colon once food finally moves through.<\/p>\n      <p><strong>Three actives, each targeting a specific GLP-1 gut failure. Built for the slowed-stomach problem your medication created.<\/strong><\/p>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/details>\n\n  <details class=\"motilli-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"motilli-faq__q\"><span>The 4 GLP-1 Gut Failures Motilli Was Built For<\/span><span class=\"motilli-faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/summary>\n    <div class=\"motilli-faq__a\">\n      <p><strong>1. Constipation that won&apos;t budge.<\/strong> Miralax, fiber, magnesium &mdash; all target the colon. GLP-1 slows the stomach. Motilli&apos;s apigenin tells the stomach muscle to start contracting again. Food moves forward. Your colon fills. You go.<\/p>\n      <p><strong>2. &ldquo;Rotten-egg&rdquo; sulphur burps.<\/strong> When food sits 8+ hours, bacteria ferment it. That&apos;s the sulphur. Chlorophyllin binds those compounds at the molecular level. Burps typically fade within 2 weeks.<\/p>\n      <p><strong>3. Look-pregnant 2pm bloating.<\/strong> Not weight gain &mdash; standing water and trapped gas in a stomach that can&apos;t empty. Two pant sizes off in 3 weeks once Motilli gets the stomach moving.<\/p>\n      <p><strong>4. The &ldquo;cement stomach&rdquo; feeling.<\/strong> That brick pressure under your ribs that makes you skip dinner. Gone by Day 10 for 90% of users.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/details>\n\n  <details class=\"motilli-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"motilli-faq__q\"><span>What to Expect &mdash; Week by Week<\/span><span class=\"motilli-faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/summary>\n    <div class=\"motilli-faq__a\">\n      <p><strong>Day 4&ndash;5:<\/strong> First comfortable bowel movement. Less pressure under the ribs.<\/p>\n      <p><strong>Day 7:<\/strong> Sulphur burps start fading.<\/p>\n      <p><strong>Day 10&ndash;14:<\/strong> Regular morning movements. 91% of users by Week 2.<\/p>\n      <p><strong>Week 2&ndash;3:<\/strong> Bloating drops two pant sizes. Injection day stops being something you dread.<\/p>\n      <p><strong>Week 4+:<\/strong> Daily relief without thinking about it. You stop checking restaurant bathroom locations.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/details>\n\n  <details class=\"motilli-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"motilli-faq__q\"><span>Who Is Motilli Designed For?<\/span><span class=\"motilli-faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/summary>\n    <div class=\"motilli-faq__a\">\n      <p>You&apos;re on a GLP-1 &mdash; Ozempic&reg;, Wegovy&reg;, Mounjaro&reg;, Zepbound&reg;, or one of the new oral pills.<\/p>\n      <p>You&apos;ve lost weight. The shot works. But your gut stopped working three months in.<\/p>\n      <p>You&apos;ve spent $90+\/month on Miralax, fiber, magnesium, probiotics &mdash; none of it has consistently worked.<\/p>\n      <p>You&apos;re starting to think about quitting the medication just to get your body back.<\/p>\n      <p><strong>Motilli was built for you, specifically. Not for general digestion. For the slowed-stomach problem GLP-1 medications cause.<\/strong><\/p>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/details>\n\n  <details class=\"motilli-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"motilli-faq__q\"><span>Made in the USA. Ships in 5&ndash;10 Days.<\/span><span class=\"motilli-faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/summary>\n    <div class=\"motilli-faq__a\">\n      <p>Motilli is manufactured in an <strong>FDA-registered, GMP-certified facility<\/strong> in the United States. Orders ship within 1 business day. <strong>5&ndash;10 day standard delivery.<\/strong> Free shipping over $45.<\/p>\n      <p>Every batch is third-party tested for purity and standardized for apigenin content. Vegan, Non-GMO, no artificial colors or fillers.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/details>\n\n  <details class=\"motilli-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"motilli-faq__q\"><span>The &ldquo;Stay-On-Your-GLP-1&rdquo; 90-Day Promise<\/span><span class=\"motilli-faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/summary>\n    <div class=\"motilli-faq__a\">\n      <p>Try Motilli for a full 90 days. If your stomach isn&apos;t moving on its own, if your sulphur burps haven&apos;t faded, if your bloat hasn&apos;t dropped &mdash; email us. Full refund. Keep the bottle. No return needed. No questions asked.<\/p>\n      <p>We built this product because too many people are quitting GLP-1s that were working. The only reason you should ever stop your shot is because <em>you<\/em> chose to. Not because your gut forced you to.<\/p>\n      <p><strong>73% of Motilli customers reorder. Most never use the guarantee.<\/strong><\/p>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/details>\n<\/div>\n\n<style>\n  .motilli-faq { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 18px 0 22px 0; }\n  .motilli-faq__item { background: #f3f5e8; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 8px; overflow: hidden; }\n  .motilli-faq__q { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 14px 16px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #1a1a1a; cursor: pointer; list-style: none; line-height: 1.35; }\n  .motilli-faq__q::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n  .motilli-faq__icon { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 300; color: #2d4a3a; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 10px; transition: transform .2s; }\n  .motilli-faq__item[open] .motilli-faq__icon { transform: rotate(45deg); }\n  .motilli-faq__a { padding: 0 16px 16px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: #2a2a2a; }\n  .motilli-faq__a p { margin: 0 0 8px 0; }\n  .motilli-faq__a p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n<\/style>"
          }
        },
        "list_reviews": {
